A||||8||AkursedX||Corvette kill??||||14||
Z||000000||AkursedX||09-19-2000||09:38 AM||||Ok, I will start this off by saying that I know a new corvette can blow the doors off of my GT any day of the week IF it has a competient driver.  <P>So here's my story...<BR>Well I was driving home from work last night, and I was cruising along at about 75 likeI normally do (No radar is ever on Rt 5  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> )  And I was in the left hand lane because there was a bunch of slower right hand lane traffic ahead of me.  <BR>Well all of a sudden, a new c-5 convertible vette is riding up my butt.  This really annoyed me, so I floored it and he followed right behind.  I was up to about 105 mph i think, and we started heading up the Skyway.  Well I finally managed to get into the right lane and the vette passed me, as I expected, but I wasn't about to let him go.  At the top of the Skyway is a right hand turn that I've taken at these kind of speeds before, but it's not the safest thing to do.  But I go for it anyways.  Well, the Corvette brakes pretty heavy, and I stay on the accelerator all the way through it and I manage to pass him!!!  After the turn, he stayed off the gas and I sped away with a huge grin on my face  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  <P>Again, I will reiterate that I know the vette is a better car, but it's kinda sad that most vettes never get pushed to their limits.  <BR>I AM THE CHAMPION!!!!!  j/k  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
Z||000001||HugGRRRFiero||09-19-2000||09:47 AM||||Pretty sweet.  I'd say the guy in the C5 didn't want to take a chance with his $40,000.  Bok, bok, bawk, but you can't blame him I guess.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>         <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/huggrrr.gif">       <BR>       <A HREF="mailto:HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com">HugGRRRFiero@hotmail.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000002||AkursedX||09-19-2000||09:56 AM||||I'd have to agree with you about that, it's just vette's never get driven hard.  It's like if these people are going to spend 40-50k on a car that they aren't going to drive hard, then buy a car that isn't designed to be driven hard, like a caddy or something like that.  But that's my opinion.  <BR>I mean a vette is alot better looking than a Caddy and it's just personal preference.<P>If I had 40 or 50k to spend on a car, I would just buy another fiero.  Then put more mods on it than I could possibly imagine    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>EDIT:  Spelling<p>[This message has been edited by AkursedX (edited 09-19-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000003||pollock||09-19-2000||10:09 AM||||It's like Howard Stern said on Private Parts,<BR>"A kill is a kill is a kill....."<P>I say whip ass and then talk it up.  A few years back i raced this like 8 year old kid in a new Z28 (about '97 at the time).  I revved at him at a light, and his little girlie looked at me and laughed.  I sucked the front end off of that thing.  6-7 car lengths.... he didn't catch me till i hit 3rd.  <P>Recently in my mustang i beat a '93 cobra, wayyyyy worse than the Z28.......<P>And, then again, a shitter mustang beat mine when i was having some rear end probs.  I talked to the guy and he was ecstatic.  He just better not let me catch him again, hehe... ||||reg||1
Z||000004||Fearless Freep||09-19-2000||05:23 PM||||Got my ass tore up by a 2000 Z28....good thing that me and the guy were friends...had lunch and a good laugh afterwards.  He pulled along side of me..both doing about 35mph...well I drop the gears down and floor it....well he layed down two strips of rubber for ohhhh....a good 15-20 feet.  After I caught up with him  I told him it was a damn good thing the sun was in my eyes... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
