Z||000007||Shadow Wolf||09-21-2000||02:34 AM||||I went for the economy Street Heat model that will go on any engine in a real short period of time. Comes with Bottle, Regulator, feeder hose, Cigarette lighter plug, and push button control.  The push button can easily be replaced by a regular switch just under the dashboard.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Great for giving your passengers a surprise.  ($299 USD)<P>They ALSO have Fiero Specific kits available, I came across this site after trying to find a homepage for Fiero Plus Canada which had Fiero NOS kits.  <P>Anyway, it's distributed by Performance SS and made by Compucar,the web site is....<BR> <A HREF="http://www.performancess.com/compucar.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.performancess.com/compucar.html</A> ||||reg||2
Z||000008||stsmithgt||09-21-2000||01:30 PM||||A kill doesn't have to come from a street light start.  I like sweeping passed them (ricers)in freeway junctions.  It's more a test of who has the sticker tires and better suspension set up then.  It's a rush taking a 30 mph sweeper at 60+.||||reg||1
